---
import PrivacyLayout from '@/layouts/PrivacyLayout.astro';
---

<PrivacyLayout
  title="Privacy Policy for Teditox"
  description="Privacy Policy for Teditox text editor app"
  appName="Teditox"
  lang="en"
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-sm">Last updated: August 12, 2025</p>
  <p>
    Teditox ("we", "our", "us") is a text editor app
    designed to help you edit text files on your device. This
    Privacy Policy explains how we handle your data when you use
    Teditox.
  </p>
  <h2>
    Data Collection and Usage
  </h2>
  <p>
    Teditox does not require user authentication and does not
    collect any personal information. All data related to your edited files, app settings, and recent files list are
    stored locally on your device.
  </p>
  <h3>
    Local Data Storage
  </h3>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>Edited Files:</strong>
        &nbsp;The text files you edit are stored locally on your device in your chosen locations.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>App Settings:</strong>
        &nbsp;Your app settings (e.g., theme, font size) are stored locally to
        personalize your editing experience.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>Recent Files List:</strong>
        &nbsp;A list of recently opened files is stored locally for quick access.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>
    Data Sharing
  </h2>
  <p>
    Teditox does not share your data with any third parties. All
    data remains on your device and is not transmitted to any
    external servers or services, unless you explicitly choose to share files using your device's sharing functionalities.
  </p>
  <h2>
    Data Security
  </h2>
  <p>
    We prioritize the security of your data. Since all data is
    stored locally on your device, it is protected by your device's
    security measures. We recommend using a secure password or
    biometric authentication to protect your device.
  </p>
  <h2>
    Changes to This Privacy Policy
  </h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes
    will be posted within the app, and we encourage you to review
    this policy periodically.
  </p>
  <h2>
    Contact Us
  </h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy,
    please contact us at miche.atucha@gmail.com.
  </p>
  <p>
    By using Teditox, you agree to the terms of this Privacy
    Policy.
  </p>
</PrivacyLayout>
